Graphics Environment Manager

Historical origin
-----------------
Graphics Environment Manager did not originate with this repository. The
original Graphics Environment Manager was developed by Digital Research with
Lee Jay Lorenzen and first released on February 28, 1985. Gary Kildall oversaw
its creation at Digital Research. Dorothy McEwen Kildall co-founded Digital
Research and managed the company's marketing and daily operations.

This separate modern application is not the original Digital Research desktop
and contains no original Digital Research source code. Historical acknowledgment
does not imply affiliation with or endorsement by Digital Research or the
Kildall family.

